  "verdict": "EXACT ALGEBRAIC & 60-DPS VERIFICATION (scope-(b) at quadratic order, non-trivial inter-cusp coupling at quartic CVol / cubic longitude order): (1) For L6a4 (B_3), the 8x8 linearized gluing system at the regular-octahedral complete structure has det(M_sys) = -64i and a completely dense 8x3 shape sensitivity matrix 4*(dZ_k/du_j) in {+-1+-i}. (2) Despite shared octahedral tetrahedra, the 3x3 longitude Jacobian dv_i/du_j|_{u=0} = -2i*delta_{ij} (cusp modulus matrix tau_{ij} = +2i*delta_{ij}) is STRICTLY DIAGONAL with all 6 off-diagonal entries identically zero, forced by pairwise linking number lk(K_i, K_j) = 0 and (Z/2Z)^3 component-reversal parity. Hence at quadratic order in u, kappa_Bor^sym = 3 * kappa_per_cusp with zero off-diagonal cross-term (`sign_flip_resolved = False`). (3) Inter-cusp coupling from the shared octahedral edges first enters at 3rd order in v_i (4th order O(u^4) in CVol): d^3 v_i / du_i^3 = +i/2 while d^3 v_i / (du_i du_j^2) = -i/2 (j != i), so v_i(u) = -2i*u_i + (i/12)*u_i^3 - (i/4)*u_i*sum_{j!=i} u_j^2 + O(u^5). On the symmetric locus u_1=u_2=u_3=u, the two inter-cusp cross-terms flip the sign of the cubic longitude coefficient from +i/12 to -5i/12 (verified to < 10^{-36} against 60-dps Newton solves).",
